@startuml
title Step 0: Product order handling aspects

participant "Product Order\nCapture &\nValidation" as POCV
participant "Event Management" as Event #grey
participant "Product Order\nDelivery & Orchestration\nManagement" as PODOM
participant "Product Inventory" as PI

== Step 0 ==

POCV -> PODOM : 1 **TMF622 Product Order Management**\nPOST /productOrder\n(productOrder)
activate PODOM
PODOM -> PODOM : 2 validate productOrder
PODOM --> POCV : 3 **TMF622** 201 Created\n(productOrder, state="acknowledged")

PODOM -> PI : 4 **TMF637 Product Inventory Management**\nPOST /product\n(state="created")
activate PI
PI --> PODOM : 5 **TMF637** 201 Created\n(product)
deactivate PI

PODOM -> PODOM : 6 start execution of productOrderItems\nupdate productOrder (state="inProgress")

PODOM -> Event : 7 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST event productOrderStateChange\n(state="inProgress")
activate Event
Event -> POCV : 8 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST listener/productOrderStateChange\n(state="inProgress")
deactivate Event

PODOM -> PI : 9 **TMF637 Product Inventory Management**\nPATCH /product\n(state="pendingActive")
activate PI
PI --> PODOM : 10 **TMF637** 200 OK\n(product)
deactivate PI
deactivate PODOM

@enduml
